ration, and lifecycle stages. Within CAD/CAM Integration and Product Data, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of digital thread within CAD/CAM, particularly where the CAD/CAM Integration and Product Data module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of digital thread, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'digital thread; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of digital thread, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; CAD/CAM', 'Active'), ('KCR_000504', 'model-based definition', 'Engineering & Technology', 'CAD/CAM', 'Technical Concept', 'Using a 3D digital product model as the authoritative source for geometry, dimensions, tolerances, and manufacturing information.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of model-based definition within CAD/CAM, particularly where the CAD/CAM Integration and Product Data module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of model-based definition, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Using a 3D digital product model as the authoritative source for geometry, dimensions, tolerances, and manufacturing information. Within CAD/CAM Integration and Product Data, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of model-based definition within CAD/CAM, particularly where the CAD/CAM Integration and Product Data module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of model-based definition, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'model-based definition; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of model-based definition, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; CAD/CAM', 'Active'), ('KCR_000505', 'measurement principles', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Mechatronics', 'Technical Concept', 'Principles governing how a physical quantity is defined, measured, represented, and related to an indicated value and measurement uncertainty.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of measurement principles within Mechatronics, particularly where the Sensors and Transducers module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of measurement principles, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Principles governing how a physical quantity is defined, measured, represented, and related to an indicated value and measurement uncertainty. Within Sensors and Transducers, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of measurement principles within Mechatronics, particularly where the Sensors and Transducers module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of measurement principles, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'measurement principles; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of measurement principles, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Mechatronics', 'Active'), ('KCR_0