arly where the Actuators and Drives module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of DC motors, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Electric motors that convert direct-current electrical input into controlled rotary mechanical motion. Within Actuators and Drives, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of DC motors within Mechatronics, particularly where the Actuators and Drives module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of DC motors, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'DC motors; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of DC motors, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Mechatronics', 'Active'), ('KCR_000511', 'stepper motors', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Mechatronics', 'Technical Concept', 'Motors that move in discrete angular steps in response to commanded electrical sequences.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of stepper motors within Mechatronics, particularly where the Actuators and Drives module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of stepper motors, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Motors that move in discrete angular steps in response to commanded electrical sequences. Within Actuators and Drives, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of stepper motors within Mechatronics, particularly where the Actuators and Drives module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of stepper motors, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'stepper motors; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of stepper motors, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Mechatronics', 'Active'), ('KCR_000512', 'servo drives', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Mechatronics', 'Technical Concept', 'Closed-loop drive systems that regulate motor position, speed, or torque using feedback.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of servo drives within Mechatronics, particularly where the Actuators and Drives module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of servo drives, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Closed-loop drive systems that regulate motor position, speed, or torque using feedback. Within Actuators and Drives, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of servo drives within Mechatronics, particularly where the Actuators and Drives module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of servo drives, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'servo drives; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of servo drives, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Mechatronics', 'Active'), ('KCR_000513', 'solenoids', 'Engineering & T